{"format_version":2,"id":"18d4b6fe61785fb8d79b1200e1754547bf8d14dcc99af921","commits":["0e2870d0baba0939b75b69c352b5efb81e0b988e","33af4d73edf7d3a6d41e2a0e18c773eaa46b2ff7"],"user_facing":true,"description":"**The blog commands moved under one `blog` group.** `selfdoc post X` is now `selfdoc blog post X`, `selfdoc editor X` is now `selfdoc blog editor X`, and `selfdoc docs publish` is now `selfdoc blog publish-docs`; change any hook, script or alias that spells an old path.","type":"breaking"}
